  "compatibilityPromises": [
    "Unclassified callers may import settings internals during inventory; imports from classified domains remain subject to cross-domain rules.",
    "The legacy ComfySettingsDialog behind app.ui.settings remains the extension-facing seam for addSetting, getSettingValue, setSettingValue, and per-setting change events.",
    "The agent consent setting id is classified here while its existing agent CODEOWNERS remain responsible for changes.",
    "Application code that reaches the backend through scripts/api, and setting definitions that call stores or LiteGraph from onChange, remain visible as role-boundary debt; classification does not grant dependency exceptions."
